            <div>
                <h1 class="h2 fw-bold mb-2">1.2 Monolithic vs Layered vs Distributed Systems</h1>
                <p class="mb-2 mb-lg-0">A practical comparison so you can choose the right architecture at the right stage of product growth.</p>
                <a href="/Microservices/Section/course-introduction" class="btn btn-sm btn-light mt-2">← Back to Course Introduction</a>
            </div>
            <div class="text-lg-end">
                <span class="topic-pill">Microservices with ASP.NET Core – Complete Syllabus</span>
